otengine/godot/issues/110316#issuecomment-3298578885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110316","id":3298578885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EnFHF","user":{"login":"Powerkrieger","id":81979050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTc5MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81979050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger","html_url":"https://github.com/Powerkrieger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Powerkrieger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T12:39:36Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T12:39:36Z","body":"Closing godot after discarding changes fixed it. Another curious thing, when typing ^ the only character I'm still able to type are ^ and the aforementioned ´. They get removed after a while into a single character though. The file remains unusable until restart.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3298578885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831037329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110316#issuecomment-3831037329","issue_url":"https://api.gith